# Shell scripts run as Docker entrypoints inside Linux containers, and as
# Claude Code hooks under Git Bash — a CRLF shebang line ("#!/usr/bin/env bash\r")
# makes the container look for a program literally named "bash\r", which doesn't
# exist. Force LF regardless of the checkout platform's core.autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf

# PDFs are binary. A generated PDF that happens to contain no CR bytes is
# guessed "text", and core.autocrlf would rewrite it on a Windows checkout.
*.pdf binary
